#: scenario3:scenario3_EE8CF67C_0217_4510_AFFD_419978E61B7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67d11236f32a3b5b9464ffe3cda647e4329bf37572c3b55d69714073d30d44b0
#. default-sha256: d1e95907082eb562792699ea8de8e228b5a6840f8c379628c8449e4f356c82d4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE8CF67C_0217_4510_AFFD_419978E61B7E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Our friendship will never change?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Hah! "
"What a fucking joke!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫\t\t⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫\t\t\t\t\t⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫なあにが変わらぬ友情だっての……。⟪k:9⟫"
"ハッ、⟪k:10⟫くだらねえ！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DE03DCD9_F0BD_444B_B962_A946DE8A7D12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 413705551a6055b210ddc6c67ecdd67ec3edf5a6330937d287df2cf77da7ef92
#. default-sha256: 0c12a3a3b87045d93334456155df67694102de1f6c74afffd8564aed72268ca8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DE03DCD9_F0BD_444B_B962_A946DE8A7D12"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You picked the wrong girl to put your trust in.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And they call you “astute.” "
"Can you ⟪k:4⟫taste⟪k:5⟫ the fucking irony?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫あんたは信じる人を間違ってるよ。⟪k:2⟫それで観察眼があるとか言われちまうんだ、⟪k:3⟫馬鹿ら"
"しいったらありゃしない。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4E6F66EF_F7F0_4C53_B509_64822B3F3870
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6cb3a680eafefcea86f124ee9d6b9a09790b7d21982792e3fb665f2a1ef4358d
#. default-sha256: e1b2457411f022761d0a2b863c5dc76245cd7061da9b64c8be4f6a51a2bc1a44
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4E6F66EF_F7F0_4C53_B509_64822B3F3870"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, that just makes things easier for me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫まあ――こっちにとっちゃ、⟪k:2⟫都合がいいけどね。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_91908849_99EB_49C9_B70D_4697FFC5B83E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a127f20d62fb5c550798d01b45c387f2d8f9e03afb29b1821374afeb66976aaf
#. default-sha256: f5ed69a6704efe56edd13a565a334e2e63ad92ede0c04b23eef33ec272ff0e4d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_91908849_99EB_49C9_B70D_4697FFC5B83E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But my ⟪k:1⟫god⟪k:2⟫, it’s suffocating playing the good girl.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫That stupidly "
"cheerful little ray of sunshine Maria..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫まったく、⟪k:1⟫いい子を演じるのも肩が凝るものだな。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫明るくて素直で馬鹿みたいなマリー"
"アさん――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_25878519_CDCD_411E_A2D0_DAFE5078ED3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0241a989c50766de7b8a4f1ca360bdca839b96adb9b60ff4df199849383988b
