msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can’t stop!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫止められないんだけどねェッ！！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_60039B01_194E_401F_887A_8CA90615E312
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abf9ec8c98a92766bc3a2cc61f3c6bfef677cd769fb1728204ac04545f23e50d
#. default-sha256: bd8da06b7eef7cc93d1164f1e58ea57a933cebe66529d94051715dad5304e51e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_60039B01_194E_401F_887A_8CA90615E312"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫God, watching him lose his cool was ⟪k:1⟫incredible⟪k:2⟫!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My sides hurt just "
"thinking about it!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ほんっと見物だったよ、⟪k:1⟫あのうろたえ振り！⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫今思い出しても、⟪k:4⟫おかしくって腹が"
"よじれちまうよ！！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F97C4C36_6410_47A6_8CF2_596B69E2AF16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9b99d8ce1d271a67c1710263254527a8982934d06e10a6eaba344fae1b7bf50
#. default-sha256: 210e5f68146bd42c2c600da59b1bb70f5a9c1b2714ab30990752f9589b8f45f0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F97C4C36_6410_47A6_8CF2_596B69E2AF16"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫You’re "
"saying... ⟪k:16⟫You’re telling me ⟪k:17⟫she⟪k:18⟫ wrote this?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫これを、"
"⟪k:16⟫あいつが……、⟪k:17⟫あいつが書いたというのか！！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5BB701E4_DD4A_498E_8FC8_1AF132DF6C84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3dec6faee9884660889f95309f3115dab7edbc82e4692d2b515728c21ee91df
#. default-sha256: a4fc09312e7ecd870b4706303ad92fceb591f97094ed6c8e8d374301a3a865d2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5BB701E4_DD4A_498E_8FC8_1AF132DF6C84"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Who else could have written it?⟪k:2⟫It’s in her handwriting..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫奥さま以外にいないじゃん、⟪k:2⟫筆跡だってその通りだよ……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4EDA082F_906A_43F4_94E5_04D1190033D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbd9647b2648d35fe6cab6214b9ad35c8bf9514d774cc41b81757bbc41a2aae4
#. default-sha256: da19d68cd4e0448aea9fe84a3b5af8f7a21a9a59783752edcf3700cf0f2831cb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4EDA082F_906A_43F4_94E5_04D1190033D6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Why... ⟪k:2⟫Why?!⟪k:3⟫Why must she continue to betray me?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫なぜ……、⟪k:2⟫なぜだ……！　⟪k:3⟫なぜあいつは、⟪k:4⟫私を裏切り続ける！！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A1AB147C_DC3A_44FA_B5BC_F5B6FE6F1D56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb7fb85724a4709e219f34be77944d1e583b91883a2adeb5ed9c1145196d6328
#. default-sha256: c50628cbe2c2ae9f2bb88930a9e4e3403de44488534f8474f065fdd025b0926b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A1AB147C_DC3A_44FA_B5BC_F5B6FE6F1D56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Has she not taken enough already?!⟪k:1⟫What else could she possibly want from me?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まだ足りないのか――！　⟪k:1⟫これ以上何を奪えばいい！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_97EBAC32_A89C_4B29_B468_333EE3FE3BB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1582ec7e76b7d69702a2f24b354e1dc5b0badd7cdf5e509fc07fe641e86b26f4
#. default-sha256: 423b6d7db6ca452f3481d572d089ba125057413b71c1c48a32899a7930b756b7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_97EBAC32_A89C_4B29_B468_333EE3FE3BB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I told her to stay away from my gatherings!⟪k:1⟫I had the rose garden torn down!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫会合にだって顔を見せないように言った！　⟪k:1⟫薔薇園だって壊した！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_94B079D8_7624_490E_8E12_1AA61EC4CD7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea1fcadc5964341df72dd2161c4654541dca6b34a136ddaf54c2ef4cae46258e
#. default-sha256: 8dc2ab4b38033937c316c9d02a5ecddc1526e6a9f7139dd0449cfffe8bbca80a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_94B079D8_7624_490E_8E12_1AA61EC4CD7E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And yet still... ⟪k:1⟫she finds other men—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それなのに、⟪k:1⟫まだ、⟪k:2⟫他の……男と……！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4C875E8F_EAB6_42A4_96A3_49E3618C9C8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd565d6c91aeab821a38e52ac8b426ad57fa1a789013c09fb02208382b2ddb17
#. default-sha256: 42d4baea63bfbeeef848bda87e1728b0aa1d4ae132a0dfcff460a93362107b10
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4C875E8F_EAB6_42A4_96A3_49E3618C9C8C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I warned her!⟪k:1⟫Told her it wouldn’t happen again!⟪k:2⟫That if she betrayed me one more "
"time, I’d kill her!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫言ったはずだ、⟪k:1⟫裏切るなと……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫次はないと――殺してやると！！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_056B5CAF_3DF7_475B_9599_4F8E78478EFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4693bb5a76fceb41ca09b096e3dae4abe2a3ad9c68f9402539d30cad3788f79
#. default-sha256: b2b8fcff429aed1e1393a94ab5cac752b6f7e2004507de397653e2bfaaed3e3a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_056B5CAF_3DF7_475B_9599_4F8E78478EFE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……ヤコポ……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6EC9BC0C_6BBB_4442_9FEB_25A76E9167B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57e15e09950407fac01ece4d889995407d626d1f3c9c4abc8836743ac9f0fcec
#. default-sha256: af5f72dce56b19a1be6f2829d24858fc121bad1ac94a5c71bc3aa5d56f819316
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6EC9BC0C_6BBB_4442_9FEB_25A76E9167B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Out of my way, Maria! I have to talk to her!⟪k:2⟫Ask her what this letter’s about! Who "
"this man is!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫どけ、⟪k:2⟫マリーア！！　⟪k:3⟫あいつと話をする！　⟪k:4⟫この手紙が何なのか――この男が誰な"
"のか！　⟪k:5⟫問いただしてやる……！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6B96DA7E_07C1_4CF3_A411_58AB52CF3395
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 313d8a09cbaa08bbbf0808f1d5ae3f20f64a03c828c47ca0b631daf92aa27397
#. default-sha256: 4605c074d7a50ef488e4f017151862cc5553f16b3ecf65df24fb903919bd99b3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6B96DA7E_07C1_4CF3_A411_58AB52CF3395"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And depending on how she answers—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫返答によっては、⟪k:1⟫あいつを―――ッ！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_39EC63E7_CD1C_4029_A26C_7E95139CD432
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 486c2e507ceec0be50b20b2e06d8288b79347154a47249641b084553efa01978
#. default-sha256: 5b8463a1f29f8626a51d9fdb4f16b35ca8e297772112745ceca09d468095c658
